# ---------- Terraform ----------
# Provider downloads (recreated by `terraform init`)
.terraform/
# State: can contain secrets; moves to S3 in the next step. NEVER commit.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
# Variable values (your IP, later secrets). Values come from CI variables instead.
*.tfvars
crash.log
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored: commit it so
# CI uses exactly the same provider versions as your laptop.

# ---------- Build outputs (CI builds these fresh) ----------
lambda/bootstrap
lambda/lambda.zip
*.exe

# ---------- Local test data ----------
sample.jsonl

# ---------- Editors / OS ----------
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db